== Notes ==
* Has the same skin when built as standard Shield Generator.
* Shares the skills cooldowns with Shield Generator while having separate cooldowns with Superior Shield Generator.
* This item was originally called "Guild Shield Generator Blueprint" until the [[blueprint]] system was simplified as part of the [[Game updates/2024-11-19|November 19, 2024 update]].

